<p><b>Agartala,</b> the capital of Tripura is a place north-east India. Located close to the neighboring country of Bangladesh in Agartala is rich in flora and fauna, the legendary status Lapland is a beautiful world in itself. Agartala Lapland and is the administrative center of the laid-back, has imposed Maharaja Krishna Manikya moved the capital here in the 19th century. This market town for rice, tea, jute and oilseeds, is the commercial heart of the area around it. Agartala Lapland and also owns the <b>Kolkata airport</b> connections.</p>

<b>Main Attractions:</b> Mountains, Greenery</p>

